    "enUS": {
      "description": "I noticed a few rocks that seemed unusual in the Dustbowl. Upon closer inspection, I saw that they had carvings! I could not resist making rubbings of them to study later.\r\n\r\nThe nearby ogres took notice of my presence and before I could even react, I woke up under the care of the innkeeper, and with a terrible headache.\r\n\r\nNow, I am down all of my supplies and without any study material while I heal. Can you venture to the east in search of my pack, and take rubbings of the etchings yourself?",
      "dialogue": {
        "05bfc6a43f81cbe0ed4f": "Have you any luck?"
      },
      "objectiveLines": [
        {
          "index": 2,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Small rock rubbing",
          "type": "object"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Large rock rubbing",
          "type": "object"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Slay ogres in the Dustbowl for Mus'hale's Stolen Supplies and use them to collect rubbings of the nearby stone etchings, then return to Mus'hale at Kargath.",
      "title": "Supplies and Studies",
